{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/TheChrisHatfield/StableProjectorz/pull/1","repo":"TheChrisHatfield/StableProjectorz","number":1,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Clarify smudge Thompson bandit scope in scheduler docs","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nThe smudge-route Thompson sampler in `PaintUndo_Scheduler` only chooses whether to build the full multi-layer underlay for neighbor sampling or skip that pass. It does not learn Art UV vs mesh accumulation vs layer-stack **write** targets; those are fixed by `SmudgeStrokeRouter` and layer gating. This updates the misleading XML summary so future readers do not expect cross-domain adaptive routing from that bandit.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-fe7421f3-d5f5-499f-98a7-8a99b50b68b7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-fe7421f3-d5f5-499f-98a7-8a99b50b68b7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n","authorType":"User","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changedFiles":1,"files":[{"path":"Assets/_gm/Features/Paint/Undo/PaintUndo_Scheduler.cs","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"baseSha":"c4e6ecfc040aa5aabb89ae9ef5213bd5e4967ad0","template":null}